DESCRIPTION

  A very simple and small BOOPSI class which creates a framed groupborder
  visual image.

  The source is just grabbed from a program of mine and may contain custom
  functions.  It should however be easy enough to figure out how this
  class works and make the small adjustments necessary before including
  it in your own code.
  
FEATURES

  o Group frame title which may be aligned left, centre or right.
  o May use own font in group frame title.
  o Built on the BUTTON class so that it is refreshed as normal
    gadgets.

REQUIREMENTS

  OS 2.04 or higher.

